{"id": "1543598817654472844", "channel_id": "1543598817654472844", "author_id": "804166342928367684", "author_name": "0760902", "content": "請問這遊戲以強度面來討論\n是不是可以先忽略角色是什麼型 \n而是去關注 某隻強度角色需要 「幾+幾」 以一隻角色的資源\n配上其他3隻能搭配上的掛件角色來遊玩?\nEX: 茉夏 3+3  就很足夠了 \n如以上沒錯的話 我是否不該再繼續投入5角混池了 轉而投資茉夏3啟最為恰當\n\n附上BOX 及覓星於懷選擇 請參考 這5個角色跟命輪 獨缺喚醒體鳥哥\n目前6章結束 \n先感謝各位大佬解惑", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T12:30:36.808000+00:00", "thread_id": "1543598817654472844", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-30T13:06:26.664000+00:00", "reactions": [{"emoji": "Celeste_agree", "emoji_id": "1400771815076528258", "count": 1}], "attachments": [{"id": "1543598818027905064", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 955057, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1543598817654472844/1543598818027905064/image.png?ex=6a9573ec&is=6a94226c&hm=e2e7dd20ed9b4688ebdf28574050c4982f48ccd86aa5fba775b41796b29fc327&"}, {"id": "1543598818694795394", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 894666, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1543598817654472844/1543598818694795394/image.png?ex=6a9573ed&is=6a94226d&hm=718d5536c25454bced177ebfc116e3de8b5286e7290cb0f7c950003ef0cf9a29&"}, {"id": "1543598819051180254", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 1016012, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1543598817654472844/1543598819051180254/image.png?ex=6a9573ed&is=6a94226d&hm=7e5cc671c550be88676e963d4611213a8a6e79330e56595fc7ca083f1ae33099&"}], "thread_title": "求大佬解惑 每天都有新的遊戲理解...", "forum_channel_id": "1356200054276493444", "is_thread_starter": true}
